ChrHack 2.3 is now available. 

ChrHack is a graphical frontend for Nethack 3.1 on IBMpc's and compatables
with EGA/VGA graphics running MSDOS or OS/2 in a Dos Full Screen window.
(OS/2 not fully tested.)

Monsters, items, symbols, and even the text font can be redefined to your
taste using 16x8 bitmaps.

New features include:
   * command line support for loading different font data files.
   * transfer the graphic icons from one file to another individually
   * improvements to the editor

Now available for FTP at:
wuarchive.wustl.edu:/pub/MSDOS_UPLOADS/games/chrhac23.arj

This is a shareware product.  If you use it and like it, please register
ChrHack with me.  More info available in the readme file in the archive.

